--- !u!114 &419953787
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 419953785}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 3928d8b915be1a3478e1324b6a666c83, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  DialogueText: {fileID: 1089097950}
  Sentences2:
  - "Bitch-ass captain making me do this- who the HELL does he think he is, ordering
    me around? \u201CFor the good of the expedition, I expect you to do your part,
    and make entries into our data logs, Jessica\u201D. What, you think I\u2019m
    gonna listen just because you caught me stealing your shoes? Bitch-ass hoe. First
    of all you can fuck right off with this \u201CJessica\u201D bullshit.  "
  - "What, you think I\u2019m gonna respect you more if you use the nickname that
    I had when I was SEVEN? You can suck my left nut if you think that I\u2019m going
    to pull some \u201Cscientifically minded\u201D hypothesis out of my ass like
    Dillie and Kris. BITCH I CAN\u2019T EVEN LOCATE A MISSING SHOE, what the hell
    do you think I\u2019m realistically gonna be able to accomplish that our \u201Ccertified
    extraplanetary explorers\u201D can\u2019t do on their own?"
  - "I wonder if I could actually borrow a shoe off of Dylan. We\u2019re a similar
    enough size, plus I could never steal from him. He\u2019s the realest bitch on
    the crew- no offense, Grady."
  Name: {fileID: 658754247}
  DialogueSpeed: 0.05
  dialo: {fileID: 1987925504}
