--- !u!114 &515757093
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 515757091}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: d45a6b8006588a142adef981ed7fb983, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  DialogueText: {fileID: 1496123730}
  Sentences7:
  - 'WHAT THE *unintelligible* GOING ON? MONTY, YOU BEST GET YOUR *unintelligible*
    BEFORE *unintelligible* YOUR ASS. *prolonged silence* I think- I think for the
    first time in my life I''m actually scared. Not like the time when I stole that
    damned car- to think that a fucking larceny charge would put me here, and not
    even Jesse could have- ARGH. '
  - "I think- *unintelligible* Oh, god. I think Jesse is dead. I would have heard
    that idiot otherwise. He simply won\u2019t shut up and for all his faults, I
    really worry. I think something bad, something HORRIBLE is going to happen. Sorry-
    wait, *unintelligible* "
  - "I think it\u2019s currently happening. With the way the system\u2019s been acting
    up, and- *unintelligible* I tried to get to Monty, but that prick just locked
    the Nav room from the inside when he saw me. Stars-damned fools, all of them.
    And I can\u2019t help but feel that, despite everything I\u2019ve been through,
    all I\u2019ve done- *unintelligible* That this is my fate. "
  Name: {fileID: 1330357868}
  dialo: {fileID: 1964262940}
  DialogueSpeed: 0.05
