--- !u!114 &1018811163
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1018811161}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 064e1a729cfc49844a8f6a5aae67d94a, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  DialogueText: {fileID: 720910478}
  Sentences3:
  - "Um, Time- Time Log: Day 14 of Starward Expeditionary Voyage III post cryo-sleep.
    0900 hours- wait, sorry- 0800 hours.Dylan, listen. Grady came to me earlier-
    I think we\u2019ve been lied to. Apparently this ship was never meant to \u201Cdiscover\u201D
    alien life- I think that our government KNEW that something was out here. And
    we\u2019re not explorers- not really. Apparently we\u2019re\u2026 sacrifices. "
  - "*silence* If this ends up going poorly, I\u2019m really sorry for everything,
    Dylan. I wish that we had a better idea of what was happening, and I WISH I didn\u2019t
    insist on bringing you along with me. I\u2019m just sorry. For everything. Under
    the assumption that you DO wake up soon, and that something DOES go wrong by
    the time you\u2019re up, there are emergency protocols in the navigation room.
    I\u2019m not sure what\u2019s going to happen, but if you\u2019re seeing this
    then something happened to me.  "
  - "I\u2019m killing the power to your room so the door stays locked and hopefully
    you don\u2019t open it until the coast is clear- Shit, Jesse is yelling about
    something. Listen, I\u2019m going to check on him, and then I\u2019m going to
    hopefully get to the bottom of this.  End Data Log. "
  Name: {fileID: 1921325792}
  DialogueSpeed: 0.05
  dialo: {fileID: 0}
