--- !u!114 &1133210954
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1133210953}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 9b21b214d33478b46995f7cae3798250, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  DialogueText: {fileID: 720910478}
  Sentences:
  - "Time Log: Day 13 of Starward Expeditionary Voyage. 0300 hours. Our observations
    thus far have shown that this region of space is every bit as uninhabited as
    we first thought. In addition, our scientists were correct when they predicted
    that our gravity stabilisers in the ship would eat up too much power, we\u2019ve
    had to disable them to conserve energy for whatever Monty is calling \u201Cthe
    main event\u201D, whatever that means."
  - " I do wish that Dylan and I had more to do in all honesty, but I am enjoying
    getting to see anomalies up close. Of course, it would be MORE enjoyable if Dylan
    didn\u2019t take more naps than the average housecat, leaving me alone and bored
    for half of the day. I suppose, as per the captain\u2019s request, if there was
    one thing that I could have changed on the ship here\u2026 if I can\u2019t choose
    Dylan\u2019s apparent need for multiple naps\u2026 maybe Johannes could ease
    up on this whole \u201Creligion\u201D thing?"
  - "To be honest, I\u2019m pretty sure he\u2019s in a cult\u2026 but regardless
    he\u2019s pretty harmless. I just wish he\u2019d stop bothering me with it. End
    Data Log. "
  Name: {fileID: 1921325792}
  DialogueSpeed: 0.05
  dialo: {fileID: 2004216351}
  P: {fileID: 978534965}
