--- !u!114 &1188774432
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1188774430}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: d4b8f3f33bc0972448b337d74773c960, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  DialogueText: {fileID: 1506318102}
  Sentences8:
  - "I HAVE SEEN THE LIGHT I HAVE SEEN IT I HAVE SEEN- *heavy breathing* Oh stars
    above, what have I been doing? WE invited it in, for WE are the chosen- At least
    that\u2019s what we were told. I don\u2019t know what *unintelligible*, but- "
  - "Our Work, our glorious Divine Purpose seems to have gone awry, the Salvation
    of Jesse did not *unintelligible* and I watched as it *unintelligible* but a
    pile of ash. And It Returns, I Can See It Now, For IT RETURNS *unintelligible*
    THIS IS TO BE THE END, I CAN FEEL *unintelligible* WASHING OVER- No, no, no *unintelligible*
    no no NO PLEASE PLEASE YOU MUST HEAR ME, EYE- *unintelligible* BEEN THE MOST
    FAITHFUL *unintelligible* *prolonged silence* (...) It\u2019s- It spared me?
    Why? "
  - "Have I truly been steadfast enough in my faith? I doubted. I- I- No. I deserve
    this. I DESERVE to be Exempted from divine punishment, because YES, I ALONE have
    been FAITHFUL. Not even Fletcher himself would have been spared in the same way
    as I! YES, I AM THE CHOSEN *unintelligible* *silence, followed by more static*
    \u2026And In My Hubris, I Have Declined To Examine The Possibility. That It Was
    Not Yet My Time To Face Judgement. But Now,*unintelligible* appears to be. This
    is *unintelligible* This Is My Fate. "
  Name: {fileID: 1942005477}
  dialo: {fileID: 647371995}
  DialogueSpeed: 0.05
