--- !u!114 &1289030254
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1289030252}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: c55bc418948d4bf479297fba95d3776e, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  DialogueText: {fileID: 623554184}
  Sentences4:
  - "I DON\u2019T WANT TO BE HERE  That scum-sucking RAT Monty told me to stay away
    from the nav room. Like sure, even if I knew what I was doing, you think I\u2019d
    really want to mess with your shit, O Captain my Captain? Piss off. I think it\u2019s
    finally here. They told us in some kinda briefing, sure, but not even Jesse was
    paying attention during that shit. Like c\u2019mon, a free trip to space in exchange
    for not serving a life sentence in prison? "
  - "That\u2019s a deal ANYONE in our shoes would have taken but I didn\u2019t think
    it would actually happen, man. I need to leave RIGHT NOW. But I can\u2019t. 
    The explorers don\u2019t know what we\u2019re here for. That weirdo Johannes
    does, but I think he wanted to come along on this mission? I don\u2019t trust
    \u2018im, and I DON\u2019T believe him for a second when he says that he has
    a loving wife."
  - " Dude\u2019s too\u2026 weird for that. Anyways, I\u2019m gonna warn Kris. Hopefully
    she and Dylan can figure out some way to escape, if that idiot isn\u2019t sleeping
    the day away.  Someone has to know this is wrong. And to whoever is seeing this,
    I hold each and every one of you accountable for letting this happen.  FUCK you. "
  Name: {fileID: 1010703489}
  DialogueSpeed: 0.05
  dialo: {fileID: 589860040}
