  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 44de643607a90c84ab1288c7d229f5c6, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  DialogueText: {fileID: 20778033}
  Sentences5:
  - IT IS HERE! The work of the faithful is often seen as unjustified and unappreciated,
    but soon they shall all understand what we have done, WHY we have done it. The
    ungrateful and ignorant can hardly be considered at fault *unintelligible* shall
    soon see Its divine glory and bask *unintelligible* majesty of Its light.
  - "The Eye of an angel\u2026 I knew It would one day pass judgement upon us, and
    I am indeed thankful for my devotion, as it has brought me thus far. I have saved
    my wife, for she lies with It now in Its divine palace beyond the stars\u2026
    My trials are far from over, and yet I cannot help but shake with excitement.
    Much work to be done, yes- I think that *unintelligible* has done good work,
    and we shall soon see the fruits of our labors come to be harvested."
  Name: {fileID: 421608137}
  DialogueSpeed: 0.05
  dialo: {fileID: 219317223}
